\alttext(Both complete compact models fit192 visible Adam updates. Separate objective/validation panels retain their different sparse-CE versus dense-Dice protocols;paired learned/BN restoration precedes all test slices and metrics.)

After restoration,U-Net test Dice.319163 reflects substantial oversegmentation:
6762 false foreground voxels versus three missed foreground voxels. Dense-label
V-Net reaches Dice.991557,with14 false positives and15 misses. Their different
annotation/loss protocols prevent interpreting this as an architecture ranking.
The actual slice galleries retain the U-Net failure rather than presenting
only successful masks.

